/P 62 0 R
/E (The contract demonstrates sound arithmetic majority voting logic and correct reentrancy protection for fund release. However, escrow immutability is not enforced, introducing systemic integrity risk. The highest priority remediation is enforcing escrow ID uniqueness to prevent state overwrite and quorum manipulation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
